artfct-pstack is an add-on that works alongside pstack (https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/main/pstack,
MIT, copyright Lauren Tan, author handle poteto). It is not a rebrand of pstack, and nothing here
implies endorsement by Cursor or SpaceXAI. Skill bodies and playbooks above are adapted from pstack
material under the terms above; `src/`, `plugin.json`/`package.json` manifests, and the
`setup-pstack-omp` / Artfct-publish additions are original contributions under the same license.
